+// The opening of the prompt a hand of its own takes, shared by the pull that
+// writes it and the door that reads it, so a spawn of that hand takes no tag.
+// [[spec/design_output/pull#a-hand-of-its-own]]
+package q
+
+// The words a hand of its own opens its prompt on, before its name. [[spec/design_output/pull#a-hand-of-its-own]]
+const HandOfItsOwn = "You are a hand of your own on this box"
